    "title": "Verify Preorder Serialization of a Binary Tree",
    "category": "Stack",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "A binary tree is serialized using preorder traversal. Each node is represented by its value, and null nodes are represented by '#'. Given the serialization string, determine whether it represents a valid binary tree without reconstructing the tree.",
